# Every checkout has LF line endings, Windows included. Git for Windows converts text files
# to CRLF on checkout by default (core.autocrlf=true); that breaks the shell scripts and changes
# the bytes that SHA-256 checks, snapshots and fixtures compare. Committed blobs are unchanged.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.step -text
*.stp -text
